### 3.8 Environment Security Configuration

Implemented environment-based configuration using python-dotenv.

Created the following files:

- .env — Private local environment configuration.
- .env.example — Shareable environment configuration template.

Updated Django settings to retrieve the secret key and debug configuration from environment variables.

Generated a replacement secret key because the original development key was potentially exposed through an earlier Git commit.

Verified that the private .env file is ignored by Git.

The original key must not be reused because it may remain in repository history.

After the security configuration changes, Django system checks and all four automated tests passed successfully.

